#: warehouse/templates/500.html:11
msgid ""
"<p>We are experiencing technical issues that are affecting our ability to "
"serve you this site.</p> <p>We are aware of the problem and are working to "
"resolve it as soon as possible.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Vi har tekniska problem som påverkar vår möjlighet att tillhandahålla den"
" här webbplatsen.</p> <p>Vi känner till problemet och arbetar för att lösa "
"det så snart som möjligt.</p>"

#: warehouse/templates/500.html:20
msgid "Check our status page"
msgstr "Se vår statussida"

#: warehouse/templates/500.html:25
msgid "Error code 500"
msgstr "Felkod 500"

#: warehouse/templates/500.html:30
msgid "Rely on PyPI to get your job done?"
msgstr "Förlitar du dig på PyPI för att få ditt arbete gjort?"

#: warehouse/templates/500.html:32
msgid ""
"Consider <a href=\"https://github.com/pypi/warehouse\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">contributing</a> or <a "
"href=\"https://psfmember.org/civicrm/contribute/transact?reset=1&id=13\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">donating</a> to help us build a more "
"stable and secure platform."
msgstr ""
"Överväg att <a href=\"https://github.com/pypi/warehouse\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">bidra</a> eller <a "
"href=\"https://psfmember.org/civicrm/contribute/transact?reset=1&id=13\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">donera</a> för att hjälpa oss att bygga "
"en stabilare och säkrare plattform."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:13
msgid ""
"Choose a strong password that contains letters (uppercase and lowercase), "
"numbers and special characters. Avoid common words or repetition."
msgstr ""
"Välj ett starkt lösenord med bokstäver, både versaler och gemener, siffror "
"och specialtecken. Undvik vanliga ord och upprepningar."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:16
msgid "Password strength:"
msgstr "Lösenordsstyrka:"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(wordmark)s\", \"%(name)s\", and the blocks logos are registered "
"trademarks of the <a href=\"%(psf_href)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Python Software Foundation</a> referring to the products "
"and services associated with pypi.org. Any other use by any other party is "
"prohibited."
msgstr ""
"\"%(wordmark)s\", \"%(name)s\" och blocklogotyperna är registrerade "
"varumärken som tillhör <a href=\"%(psf_href)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Python Software Foundation</a> och avser produkter och "
"tjänster kopplade till pypi.org. All annan användning av andra parter är "
"förbjuden."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:83
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(wordmark)s\", \"%(name)s\", and the blocks logos are registered <a "
"href=\"%(trademarks_href)s\">trademarks</a> of the <a href=\"%(psf_href)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Software Foundation</a>."
msgstr ""
"\"%(wordmark)s\", \"%(name)s\" och blocklogotyperna är registrerade <a "
"href=\"%(trademarks_href)s\">varumärken</a> som tillhör <a "
"href=\"%(psf_href)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Software "
"Foundation</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:115
msgid "TestPyPI, the Python Package Index test instance"
msgstr "TestPyPI, testinstansen för Python Package Index"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:115
msgid "PyPI, the Python Package Index"
msgstr "PyPI, Python Package Index"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:131 warehouse/templates/index.html:97
msgid ""
"The Python Package Index (PyPI) is a repository of software for the Python "
"programming language."
msgstr ""
"Python Package Index, PyPI, är ett programvaruarkiv för "
"programmeringsspråket Python."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:148
msgid "RSS: 40 latest updates"
msgstr "RSS: de 40 senaste uppdateringarna"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:152
msgid "RSS: 40 newest packages"
msgstr "RSS: de 40 nyaste paketen"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:226
msgid "Switch to mobile version"
msgstr "Byt till mobilversion"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:236
msgid "You are using an unsupported browser, upgrade to a newer version."
msgstr ""
"Du använder en webbläsare som inte stöds. Uppgradera till en nyare version."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:248
msgid ""
"You are using TestPyPI – a separate instance of the Python Package Index "
"that allows you to try distribution tools and processes without affecting "
"the real index."
msgstr ""
"Du använder TestPyPI, en separat instans av Python Package Index där du kan "
"prova distributionsverktyg och processer utan att påverka det riktiga "
"indexet."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:250
msgid ""
"We're currently testing a new design for project detail pages – <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/pypi/warehouse/issues/20267\" "
"rel=\"nofollow\">share your feedback here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vi testar för närvarande en ny utformning av projektens informationssidor. "
"<a href=\"https://github.com/pypi/warehouse/issues/20267\" "
"rel=\"nofollow\">Lämna återkoppling här</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:263
msgid ""
"Some features may not work without JavaScript. Please try enabling it if you"
" encounter problems."
msgstr ""
"Vissa funktioner kanske inte fungerar utan JavaScript. Försök att aktivera "
"det om du får problem."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:301 warehouse/templates/base.html:334
#: warehouse/templates/error-base-with-search.html:8
#: warehouse/templates/index.html:30
msgid "Search PyPI"
msgstr "Sök på PyPI"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:306 warehouse/templates/index.html:36
msgid "Type '/' to search projects"
msgstr "Skriv \"/\" för att söka efter projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:339
#: warehouse/templates/error-base-with-search.html:13
msgid "Search projects"
msgstr "Sök efter projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:365
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Developed and maintained by the <a href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Software Foundation</a> and Python"
" community, for the Python community."
msgstr ""
"Utvecklas och underhålls av <a href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Software Foundation</a> och "
"Python-gemenskapen, för Python-gemenskapen."

#: warehouse/templates/base.html:372
msgid "all systems operational"
msgstr "alla system fungerar"
